Package: libre-webui
Version: __VERSION__
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: nodejs (>= 22.22), adduser
Recommends: openssl
Suggests: docker.io
Maintainer: Libre WebUI <hello@librewebui.org>
Homepage: https://librewebui.org
Description: Privacy-first, self-hosted AI platform
 Chat with local models through Ollama or with cloud providers, plus
 agents, automations, and a knowledge base - all from a single service.
 .
 Runs as a systemd service listening on port 8080 by default. All data
 stays under /var/lib/libre-webui. Debian and Ubuntu releases ship an
 older Node.js; install Node.js 22 or newer first (for example from
 nodesource) before installing this package.
